FenrirOS: the Gradle toolchain asks for Java 19, which the tree does not have;
Java 21 (an LTS release) builds it. A patch, not a sed in setup, so that
dkbuild's Gradle dependency resolution (which sees patches) uses it too.

--- a/app/build.gradle.kts	2026-11-12 08:26:50.517164924 -0500
+++ b/app/build.gradle.kts	2026-11-12 08:26:50.520953495 -0500
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@
 // Apply a specific Java toolchain to ease working on different environments.
 java {
     toolchain {
-        languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(19))
+        languageVersion.set(JavaLanguageVersion.of(21))
     }
 }
 
